OL,3,GNEWSAGroup found guilty over fatal
OL,4,Aambush attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne man has been found guilty of murder
OL,7,Fand five of manslaughter after a
OL,8,F21-year-old man was slashed and stabbed
OL,9,Fby an armed gang wearing balaclavas.
OL,11,FDale Martin, also known as DJ, was
OL,12,Fdragged out of a car before his
OL,13,Fattackers set upon him "like a pack of
OL,14,Fanimals", a witness told the court.
OL,16,FThe attack in Derby on 15 June 2025
OL,17,Ffollowed a history of "animosity"
OL,18,Fbetween two rival groups, and two
OL,19,Fconfrontations earlier that weekend,
OL,20,Fthe court heard.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
