OL,3,GNEWSAGroup found guilty over fatal
OL,4,Aambush attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FJayden Mannion-Roberts, 26, of Tennyson
OL,7,FStreet, Derby, was found guilty of
OL,8,Fmurder by a jury at Derby Crown Court,
OL,9,Fwhich was sitting at Loughborough
OL,10,FMagistrates' Court, and five other men
OL,11,Fall from Derby were convicted of
OL,12,Fmanslaughter.
